A personal extension requires advance authorization before ticketing, and the workflow below describes the administrative path from intention to a complete file. The workflow is administrative by design: it produces the records that the cost-neutrality review and the ordinary expense process consume, and it does not itself decide what any given line item is. That decision belongs to the rules stated elsewhere in this handbook and to Figure 1.

